<title>SYRIA: Syria tenders to buy 12,000 tonnes rice.</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to buy 12,000 tonnes rice.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organisation for Chemicals and Foostuffs (GEZA) has issued an international tender to buy 12,000 tonnes of white rice for shipment in July, a company spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters that June 4 was set as final date to receive bids and the confirmation would be made on June 12.</p>
</text>
